Page 31 – Future Scope
The Library Management System can be improved in several ways:
1. Graphical User Interface: Add buttons, forms and tables using Tkinter.
2. Login System: Provide separate librarian and administrator accounts.
3. Fine Calculation: Calculate fines for late book returns.
4. Reports: Generate daily, monthly and yearly reports.
5. Barcode Scanning: Scan book barcodes for quick identification.
6. Notifications: Send reminders before the due date.
7. Database Backup: Create safe copies of the database.
8. Online Access: Allow authorised users to access the system from different computers.
9. Book Reservation: Allow members to reserve unavailable books.
These improvements can make the system more advanced and useful.
